    LLM: 'Game: No Peek Poker. Type: Poker/Blind. 2-8 players. One card each on foreheadâ€”players cannot see own card but see all others. Standard poker betting. Highest card wins.',
    Player: "Play No Peek Poker! Put your card on your foreheadâ€”don't look! Everyone else can see your card. Bet based on what you see on others' foreheads and their reactions to your card.",
