    gameplay: "1. Each player places their card on their forehead without looking (all other players can see it). 2. Betting round(s) occur where players bet based on what they see of others' cards. 3. Players can fold if they believe their card is low. 4. Showdown: remaining players reveal cards; highest card wins.",
